{"articleNo":"430113","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=430113&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교외행사] 「제1회 전국 장애공감 포스터 공모전」안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2023.04.12","hit":"2758","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/cms/plugin/editorImage.do?EwBmGYHoQFkhrAjgMQPYEFkHUCyAhAMwBUA3AcwEsBFAZwHEAvAWwoDoArABzKA%20\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">공모주제 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">함계하는 우리</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">행복한 세상</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">접수 기간 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">: 2023. 5. 8. (</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)~ 6. 9. (</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">) 17:00</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">응모 자격 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">전국 초</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">중</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">고등학생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">성인 등 누구나 응모가능</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">라</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">출품 규격 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">:  A4 </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">사이즈 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">매의 원본 이미지 포스터</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">마</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">시상 계획 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">부총리겸 교육부장관상 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">명</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">국립특수교육원장상 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">9</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">명</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">총</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">12</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">명</span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">바</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">주최</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">/</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">후원 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">국립특수교육원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\